team/apps/3423700/extras/2c24318d27043798edd3b06aad78bd26.webp?t=1755081863\" width=617 height=57 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why Keep Playing?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because I said so.<br>And because you\u2019ll unlock:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bases to decorate <i>and</i> weaponize</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ability to raid other players\u2019 bases, just to prove you can</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More weapons, more gadgets, more bad decisions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423700/extras/f9105f4e8c8ba71784d0b734df94829a.poster.avif?t=1755081863\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423700/extras/f9105f4e8c8ba71784d0b734df94829a.webm?t=1755081863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423700/extras/f9105f4e8c8ba71784d0b734df94829a.mp4?t=1755081863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You\u2019re in my company now.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proceed with the Plan A.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail, and we move to Plan B4.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail that\u2026 we\u2019ll just reuse your codename for the next recruit.</p>",
